            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>[Problem] To provide a fuel cell ship capable of minimizing damage when a storage battery explodes for some reason.[Solution] A fuel cell ship includes a storage battery compartment installed with a storage battery that supplies, to a propulsion device, electric power different from electric power by a fuel cell. The storage battery compartment is provided between a deck and a ship bottom portion of a hull.</p>
            </abstract>
